<Base lang="en" page="credits" title="Credits · Traces Blanches" description="The sources of the maps and information of Traces Blanches (IGN, OpenStreetMap, Météo-France, ARCEP, refuges.info, Camptocamp…), with the credit and licence of each.">
<div class="text">
<h1>Credits</h1>
<p class="lead">The maps and information of Traces Blanches come from public sources. Each asks to be credited, with its licence: here they are.</p>
<p>In the app, “© OpenStreetMap” will sit in a corner of the map and the other credits on a “Data licences” screen. <span class="tag plan">planned</span></p>
</div>

